      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "noise rules (NoiseFilter.cs), each on one alphanumeric chunk:\nhash: all hex, >= 8 chars with a digit (or >= 16 without)\nrandom id: >= 6 chars, has digits, >= 3 letter/digit flips   (k2x9qv1a, 8wekyb3d8bbwe)\nlong number: >= 7 digits   (20261021, epoch ms)\npublisher id: last chunk, after '_', 13 lowercase alnum, a '.' earlier   (zpdnekdrzrea0)\nguid: 8-4-4-4-12 hex chunks joined by single dashes\nopaque blob: >= 20 chars, digits and >= 3 camel humps",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
